{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.madoka.exception",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "收工之后，车还停在摄影棚外",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.madoka.exception",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.madoka.exception",
    "idolId": "madoka",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──円香，你对别人倒是普通的应对啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "什么啊，那个。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "刚才你跟工作人员聊得很起劲的样子，比如拿到慰问的蛋糕的时候……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "那种没内容的闲聊吗？我只是随便附和而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "嘛，对第一次见面的人很严厉，那才是没常识吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……………………",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，啊啊。是啊，那倒是。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……我猜猜你在想什么吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶！？不不不……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "你是例外。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "例外？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "因为从第一次见面开始，就有理由。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "唔……这样啊。被讨厌倒也不是我很擅长的……",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嘛……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我在円香身上看到了会发光的东西，所以。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "只要円香愿意留在这里，那就够了。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，我会努力让你信任我的。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "就算一直讨厌着也一样。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "你这么做，总得有个理由……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "对我──…………",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "不。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "没什么。别回答。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我可以回答吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "说了别回答。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "让我说吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "不行，忘掉。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "就算你这么说……",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "现在正是发挥鸟脑袋真正价值的时候吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "鸟、鸟脑袋……",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "不行。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "円香是──",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "说了不行的吧……！",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈哈……！",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "最差劲。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……抱歉抱歉，开玩笑的。",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天就先放过你，不过总有一天円香也会明白的。",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以，至少在那之前，希望你能留在这里。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………我知道了。",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "总之，就到你把这辆车停下来为止。",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯。我会开得很稳的。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
